# panicpersist.fpr -- a panic's last words must survive the
# process.  Under qosp the fpr_panic_persist hook appends
# "sys/panic\n<msg>" to the kv log via syscall tag 2 before dying, so a
# crash-restart loop stops destroying its own evidence (the check-all greps the record while Disk.qa shows it on the next boot).
main =
  u = error "deliberate last words";
  "unreached".
